@startuml
title <size:24>Dynamic View: nyx</size>\n<size:24>An AI host builds a model and solves it through the same commands.</size>

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam nodesep 30
hide stereotype

<style>
  root {
    BackgroundColor: #ffffff;
    FontColor: #444444;
  }
  // Element,Container,Executable
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsRXhlY3V0YWJsZQ== {
    BackgroundColor: #438dd5;
    LineColor: #2e6295;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    RoundCorner: 20;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Element,Container,Library
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ== {
    BackgroundColor: #438dd5;
    LineColor: #2e6295;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Element,Container,Library,Kernel
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeSxLZXJuZWw= {
    BackgroundColor: #2e7d32;
    LineColor: #205723;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Element,Software System,External
  .Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw= {
    BackgroundColor: #8a8a8a;
    LineColor: #606060;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
    MaximumWidth: 450;
  }
  // Relationship
  .Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw {
    LineThickness: 2;
    LineStyle: 10-10;
    LineColor: #444444;
    FontColor: #444444;
    FontSize: 24;
  }
  // nyx
  .Boundary-bnl4 {
    BackgroundColor: #ffffff;
    LineColor: #0b4884;
    LineStyle: 0;
    LineThickness: 2;
    FontColor: #ffffff;
    FontSize: 24;
    HorizontalAlignment: center;
    Shadowing: 0;
  }
</style>

rectangle "nyx\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-bnl4>> {
  component "==geom\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nLean CSG-over-B-rep geometry kernel: feature lists, named regions and boundaries, selectors, exact projection oracles. Depends on serde and optional rayon only." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.geom
  rectangle "==nyx-mcp\n<size:16>[Container: Rust binary]</size>\n\nThe MCP server (stdio, JSON-RPC 2.0): every tool is one engine command, with the JSON Schema the engine generates." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsRXhlY3V0YWJsZQ==>> as nyx.nyxmcp
  component "==nyx-engine\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe Engine: one project, the mesh built for it, the latest result of each physics, the jobs that produce them, and the binding to a workflow. Every action is a named command with a JSON Schema." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.nyxengine
  component "==nyx-ems\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nEM waves: waveguide modes (real and complex), axisymmetric, cavity in 3D." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeSxLZXJuZWw=>> as nyx.nyxems
  component "==nyx-store\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nWorkspace, workflow, experiment and run storage: manifests, append-only run log, versions, search, .nyx archives. Knows nothing of a project." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.nyxstore
  component "==femcore\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library]</size>\n\nThe FEM core: meshes, meshing and adaptation, linear algebra behind one driver, finite-element basics, the material specification and library, expressions." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTGlicmFyeQ==>> as nyx.femcore
}

rectangle "==AI host\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>\n\nClaude Code or Claude Desktop (any MCP host). Drives nyx through the engine commands as MCP tools." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw=>> as AIhost

AIhost --> nyx.nyxmcp <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "1: tools/call add_rect, add_overlay, add_physics, solve_run\n<size:16>[MCP over stdio (JSON-RPC 2.0)]</size>"
nyx.nyxmcp --> nyx.nyxengine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "2: call(command, arguments)\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxengine --> nyx.geom <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "3: feature list edit and evaluation\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxengine --> nyx.femcore <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "4: mesh\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxengine --> nyx.nyxems <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "5: solve\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"
nyx.nyxengine --> nyx.nyxstore <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "6: auto_store: the workflow shows in the dashboard\n<size:16>[Rust API]</size>"

@enduml